# What NOT to upload to EAS Build.
#
# This file lives at the REPO ROOT on purpose. EAS runs from mobile/ (where
# eas.json is) but builds the archive from the root of the git repository,
# so an .easignore inside mobile/ is not where the archive is assembled and
# does not prune it. Confirmed 2026-09-14: with only mobile/.easignore in
# place, a production build still uploaded 399 MB and spent ~3 minutes on
# it. Only ~30 MB of this repo is tracked by git, so the rest was untracked
# weight — mobile/node_modules alone is 7.6 GB raw.
#
# An .easignore REPLACES .gitignore for archive purposes, so everything
# .gitignore excludes has to be re-stated here, not just the extras.

# --- dependencies and build output (EAS reinstalls from package-lock) ---
node_modules/
/mobile/android/
/mobile/ios/
/mobile/.expo/
/mobile/.kotlin/
/mobile/.gradle/
dist/
web-build/

# --- nothing outside mobile/ is part of the app ---
# The Android app is built entirely from mobile/. Everything below is the
# data pipeline, the stats website and design scratch — none of it is
# compiled into the bundle, and the app reads its data over the network at
# runtime rather than embedding it.
#
# Every one of these is anchored with a leading slash, which matters more
# than it looks: an unanchored "app/" or "data/" matches a directory of
# that name at ANY depth, so it would also have excluded mobile/app/ (every
# expo-router screen) and mobile/src/data/. That would not fail the upload,
# it would build a broken app.
/israel-poc/
/server/
/app/
/design-import/
/docs/
/store-assets/
/data/
/scripts/
/.github/

# Built app bundles. Downloaded from EAS, then uploaded straight back to it
# on the next build: two .aab files here pushed the archive from 91 MB to
# 168 MB. Gitignored already; .easignore replaces .gitignore for the
# archive, so it has to be said twice.
/build/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# --- credentials must never leave this machine ---
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
.env
.env*.local

# --- local tooling and scratch ---
.claude/
mobile/.claude/
mobile/scripts/check-device.sh
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
.metro-health-check*

# --- OS noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
